      "id": "jjk-pg-coffin_of_the_iron_mountain-014",
      "kind": "fact",
      "question": "How did Jogo first use Coffin of the Iron Mountain against Gojo?",
      "subject": "Coffin of the Iron Mountain",
      "tier": "wiki",
      "expect_mode": "qa",
      "answer": [
        {
          "item": "Jogo first displayed his domain expansion when he was desperate to kill Satoru Gojo in their fight. In order to bypass Gojo's Infinity, Jogo needed to employ his sure-hit attacks. While a normal sorcerer would burn up inside Coffin of the Iron Mountain, Gojo was unharmed and was able to protect his student, Yuji Itadori from the heat as well.",
          "aliases": []
        }
      ],
      "sources": [
